[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150293885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117960#issuecomment-4150293885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117960","id":4150293885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73YHV9","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T14:42:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T14:42:13Z","body":"Can reproduce in both `v4.6.1.stable` and `v4.7.dev2`. Not sure if this could be caused by unusually large values (coordinate values in the order of 10k), but might be a rendering bug.\n\nSetting the polygons to inverted does render most of them correctly, but not all of them. I also tried playing with the point data and removing points until suddenly it was rendered properly:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2ace523-a39b-451a-b2d4-ec3cd306b297\n\nThis needs more testing, as the MRP code is complex.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150293885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150372401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117960#issuecomment-4150372401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117960","id":4150372401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73Yagx","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T15:25:50Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T15:25:50Z","body":"What's buggy is the generation in the MRP, it creates invalid polygons.  Not caused by the floating point errors, it generates what the code says.\n\nThe generated polygons consist of:\n- a polyline at constant radius in one direction (~average for first/last original points),\n```gdscript\nvar water_surface_radius = (p_start.length() + p_end.length()) / 2.0\nwater_surface_radius = min(water_surface_radius, base_radius - water_level_offset + 5.0)\n```\n- original \"coast\" polyline in the opposite direction.\n\nAs seen in the examples below the issue is the \"original points\" polyline might intersect the constant-radius polyline:\n<img width=\"1420\" height=\"528\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fd2b0f1-ed33-4d8a-aafe-a74b04704ea1\" />\n<img width=\"1625\" height=\"223\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5b0f5ed-c60d-449c-9e8e-00d9ea78f380\" />\n\nSo the issue is the generation algorithm.\n\n---\n\nEngine-wise, these are not rendered because the triangulation fails. It should probably error? 🤔 Specifically here it returns an empty index arrays because of the failure:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2af785641ae249573f45eb61852d22e0b1a8a03c/scene/2d/polygon_2d.cpp#L328\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150372401/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150382322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117960#issuecomment-4150382322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117960","id":4150382322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73Yc7y","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T15:31:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T15:31:26Z","body":"> Engine-wise, these are not rendered because the triangulation fails. It should probably error? 🤔 Specifically here it returns an empty index arrays because of the failure:\n\nYup, definitely a good idea to at least print a warning on the console in that case.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4150382322/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4152676664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117960#issuecomment-4152676664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117960","id":4152676664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73hNE4","user":{"login":"Omniologist","id":94089255,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZuwJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94089255?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist","html_url":"https://github.com/Omniologist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omniologist/re